{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Can You Escape: The Collection brings together <strong>23 classic escape room games</strong>, originally released on mobile, now available in one complete collection on Steam. Each game features puzzles, hidden objects, and riddles set in a variety of locations like gaming rooms, garages, offices, basements, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873140/extras/c5d12e7715134364a5c13dae3c4456f9.poster.avif?t=1773061999\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873140/extras/c5d12e7715134364a5c13dae3c4456f9.webm?t=1773061999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873140/extras/c5d12e7715134364a5c13dae3c4456f9.mp4?t=1773061999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Across the collection, you\u2019ll find <strong>over 300 rooms</strong> to unlock. All escape games are available from the start, so you can jump into any adventure you choose. The gameplay is simple, puzzle-focused, and designed for quick, satisfying challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A perfect collection for fans of <strong>retro escape games</strong> or newcomers curious to experience these early classics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873140/extras/da5f07107a67a1f3eedc373c2188ee0a.poster.avif?t=1773061999\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873140/extras/da5f07107a67a1f3eedc373c2188ee0a.webm?t=1773061999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873140/extras/da5f07107a67a1f3eedc373c2188ee0a.mp4?t=1773061999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Think you can escape them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3873140?t=1773061999","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3873140?t=1773061999","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873140/3b6b3adc1fd4368dd84c6bceb81b94a1560d1796/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773061999","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873140/3b6b3adc1fd4368dd84c6bceb81b94a1560d1796/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773061999","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4167920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Can You Escape: The Collection brings together <strong>23 classic escape room games</strong>, originally released on mobile, now available in one complete collection on Steam. Each game features puzzles, hidden objects, and riddles set in a variety of locations like gaming rooms, garages, offices, basements, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn